WEBVTT

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:32.689
I will show you this next thing,

00:07:32.713 --> 00:07:34.261
speaking of costumes for operas.

00:07:34.285 --> 00:07:36.229
I do work with different choreographers.

00:07:36.253 --> 00:07:38.156
I work with Twyla Tharp a lot

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:39.992
and I work with Mark Morris a lot,

00:07:40.016 --> 00:07:41.461
who is one of my best friends.

00:07:41.485 --> 00:07:44.976
And I designed three operas with him --

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:47.704
the most recent one, "King Arthur."

00:07:47.728 --> 00:07:50.333
I've been very ingrained
in the dance world

00:07:50.357 --> 00:07:51.508
since I was a teenager.

00:07:51.532 --> 00:07:53.437
I went to a performing arts high school,

00:07:53.461 --> 00:07:54.675
where I was an actor,

00:07:54.699 --> 00:07:56.809
and many of my friends
were ballet dancers.

00:07:56.833 --> 00:08:00.434
Again, I don't know
where inspiration comes from.